clthreads — vendored dependency

This directory contains the upstream clthreads source by Fons Adriaensen.

Upstream repository: https://github.com/dmeliza/clthreads
Upstream revision imported: 7b59da40f3cae5a86eb23bc806c2d32e128680c5

The upstream source is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License, version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version. The full license
text is in COPYING. Copyright and license notices in the imported files are
preserved. The imported implementation has not been modified.

The Windows CI job compiles this dependency using the MSYS2 UCRT64 MinGW
compiler and its POSIX-thread support. A successful compile is only a build
check; scheduling behaviour, cancellation, shutdown ordering, and real-time
audio performance still require runtime tests on Windows.
